# Cloudflare Pages — hardened security headers
#
# Policy notes (for QA verification):
# • CSP script-src 'self' — the build emits zero inline executable scripts
#   (the JSON-LD <script type="application/ld+json"> blocks in index.html are
#   data-only, NOT executable, so they are exempt from script-src per the CSP3
#   spec — no 'unsafe-inline' or nonce needed).
# • style-src 'unsafe-inline' is required: React sets style="" attributes
#   across the app (CSP treats inline style attributes as inline styles).
# • fonts: stylesheet fetched from fonts.googleapis.com (style-src), woff2
#   files from fonts.gstatic.com (font-src). App remains fully functional with
#   system-font fallback if the CDN is unreachable.
# • img-src allows Supabase storage (product/category/blog images) and
#   OpenStreetMap vector tiles (AddressMapPicker). data:/blob: keep inline
#   SVG icons working.
# • connect-src allows Supabase edge functions (create-payment, manage-gateway
#   — Midtrans key stays server-side) and nominatim reverse geocoding.
# • frame-src only privacy-friendly YouTube + Vimeo embeds (VideoEmbed).
# • frame-ancestors 'self' + X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN block cross-origin
#   clickjacking while allowing same-origin embedding (platform preview shell).
# • Permissions-Policy keeps geolocation=(self) — AddressMapPicker's "use my
#   location" button needs it; camera/microphone/payment/usb are denied.
# • COOP same-origin + CORP same-origin isolate this origin from cross-origin
#   windows (payment flow is a full-page redirect, no popup — safe).
# • upgrade-insecure-requests is a no-op on HTTPS (Cloudflare Pages is HTTPS).

X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(self), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=(), autoplay=(self), fullscreen=(self)
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.supabase.co https://*.tile.openstreetmap.org; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org; frame-src https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://player.vimeo.com https://www.youtube.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests